# Stitched fisheye panorama grid PTO — HD (5120x5120)
# Zenith at centre; South at 6 o'clock (bottom).
# PTO convention: yaw=0 is South, so r=180 rotates South to the bottom.
# Use with: drawgrid.py --panorama grid_fe_hd.pto grid_fe_hd.png
p f3 w5120 h5120 v190 r90 E0 R0 n"TIFF_m c:LZW"

i w5120 h5120 f3 v190 y0 p0 r0 a0 b0 c0 d0 e0 g0 t0 n"stitch_hires_fisheye.jpg"

